{title: Now the Green Blade Riseth}
{key: Am}
{time: 4/4}
{meta: tune FRENCH CAROL}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Am]Now the [D]green blade [Am]ri[**]seth [D]from the [F]buried [Am]grain[**]
[Am]Wheat that [D]in [Am]dark [**]earth [D]many [F]days has [Am]lain[**]
[Am]Love [**]lives a[E7]gain[**], that [Am]with the [**]dead has [E7]been[**]
[Am]Love is [D]come a[Am]gain [**]like [D]wheat that [F]springeth [Am]green[**].
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[Am]In the [D]grave they [Am]laid [**]him, [D]Love whom [F]men had [Am]slain[**]
[Am]Thinking [D]that [Am]ne[**]ver [D]he would [F]wake a[Am]gain[**]
[Am]Laid [**]in the [E7]earth[**] like [Am]grain that [**]sleeps un[E7]seen[**]
[Am]Love is [D]come a[Am]gain [**]like [D]wheat that [F]springeth [Am]green[**].
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[Am]Forth he [D]came at [Am]Ea[**]ster, [D]like the [F]risen [Am]grain[**]
[Am]He that [D]for [Am]three [**]days [D]in the [F]grave had [Am]lain[**]
[Am]Quick [**]from the [E7]dead[**] my [Am]risen [**]Lord is [E7]seen[**]
[Am]Love is [D]come a[Am]gain [**]like [D]wheat that [F]springeth [Am]green[**].
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[Am]When our [D]hearts are [Am]win[**]try, [D]grieving, [F]or in [Am]pain[**]
[Am]Thy touch [D]can [Am]call [**]us [D]back to [F]life a[Am]gain[**]
[Am]Fields [**]of our [E7]hearts[**] that [Am]dead and [**]bare have [E7]been[**]
[Am]Love is [D]come a[Am]gain [**]like [D]wheat that [F]springeth [Am]green[**].
